The first e-bike recall in these records is from 2001. For most of the next two decades there were a handful a year at most, and many years had none. Since 2022 e-bike recalls have appeared every year, and 2025 had more than any year before it. In total, 51 recall events involve e-bikes, e-bike batteries and chargers, or parts recalled from e-bikes.

